WEBVTT

00:31.630 --> 00:35.180
♪ Pink hands so fine ♪

00:35.200 --> 00:38.580
♪ Gold-branded wine ♪

00:38.850 --> 00:44.820
♪ Spring paints willows green;
palace walls can't confine ♪

00:45.980 --> 00:49.610
♪ East wind unfair ♪

00:49.630 --> 00:53.140
♪ Happy times rare ♪

00:53.160 --> 00:56.650
♪ In my heart, sad thoughts throng ♪

00:56.670 --> 01:00.180
♪ We've severed for years long ♪

01:00.200 --> 01:06.260
♪ Wrong, wrong, wrong ♪

01:19.520 --> 01:23.800
Si Jin

01:23.820 --> 01:27.800
Episode 38

01:27.800 --> 01:30.800
(Tiande Hall)

01:35.570 --> 01:37.820
Are you still the same Rongyang?

01:37.970 --> 01:39.880
What have you changed into?

01:39.900 --> 01:41.780
I barely recognize you anymore.

01:42.020 --> 01:43.570
I haven't changed.

01:45.460 --> 01:46.950
It's you who has changed.

01:47.380 --> 01:49.720
My brother would never hurt me,

01:49.740 --> 01:51.780
let alone poison me!

01:52.410 --> 01:54.110
From the moment you handed me

01:54.130 --> 01:55.700
that cup of poisoned tea,

01:55.970 --> 01:58.500
I no longer have a brother.

02:00.210 --> 02:02.330
I truly regret it.

02:02.860 --> 02:04.160
Regret what?

02:04.180 --> 02:07.000
Regret putting you on the throne.

02:07.020 --> 02:09.280
Had it been Prince Xiang on it,

02:09.300 --> 02:11.880
none of this would've happened!

02:11.900 --> 02:13.230
You're deranged!

02:13.250 --> 02:14.750
Do you hear yourself?

02:14.770 --> 02:17.030
I am the Emperor of Dazhou.

02:17.050 --> 02:18.630
What are you insinuating

02:18.650 --> 02:20.330
by saying that to my face?

02:32.930 --> 02:35.010
Nothing.

02:36.740 --> 02:38.280
From this day forward,

02:38.300 --> 02:40.140
you're no longer the Emperor.

02:40.370 --> 02:41.840
You're nothing.

02:41.860 --> 02:44.540
Guards, seize him!

03:03.620 --> 03:05.100
Greetings, Your Majesty.

03:06.180 --> 03:07.540
Cao Yong,

03:08.770 --> 03:10.510
I never thought you'd betray me.

03:10.530 --> 03:13.100
You killed my son.

03:13.770 --> 03:16.290
I've never forgotten that.

03:19.330 --> 03:21.010
Do you think you'll get your way

03:21.020 --> 03:23.070
by trapping me?

03:23.090 --> 03:25.100
I will get my way.

03:25.250 --> 03:27.260
What can you do to me?

03:59.580 --> 04:01.290
At tomorrow's morning court,

04:01.530 --> 04:04.220
I will announce to the realm

04:04.660 --> 04:06.790
that His Majesty is indisposed,

04:06.810 --> 04:08.380
and I will

04:09.490 --> 04:11.700
serve as regent.

04:20.480 --> 04:27.040
(Tiande Hall)

04:54.980 --> 04:56.450
Eunuch Liu.

05:24.980 --> 05:27.380
Si, Si!

05:29.010 --> 05:30.110
- Si!
- Miss!

05:30.130 --> 05:31.490
You're awake.

05:34.100 --> 05:35.620
Where am I?

05:35.690 --> 05:37.990
Yu told us to find a safe house

05:38.010 --> 05:39.400
for you to take shelter in

05:39.420 --> 05:41.140
once he got you out.

05:42.570 --> 05:43.840
Where is he?

05:43.860 --> 05:45.080
Don't worry, Si.

05:45.100 --> 05:47.030
He said he'd convince His Majesty

05:47.050 --> 05:48.850
to bring down the Grand Princess.

05:49.490 --> 05:51.670
Where's Father, Zhan?

05:51.690 --> 05:53.160
The Grand Princess said

05:53.180 --> 05:54.960
he went to the Palace earlier today

05:54.980 --> 05:56.790
- to file a suit.
- What?

05:56.810 --> 05:58.230
We need a plan fast

05:58.250 --> 05:59.620
to rescue Father.

05:59.980 --> 06:01.420
Calm down. You're too weak.

06:01.420 --> 06:02.780
Lie back.

06:02.980 --> 06:04.110
Yu'll come in a minute.

06:04.130 --> 06:05.700
We'll work it out together.

06:06.570 --> 06:07.720
Miss,

06:07.740 --> 06:09.550
where does it hurt, Miss?

06:09.570 --> 06:10.970
What to do?

06:11.050 --> 06:13.430
It was my fault, Miss.

06:13.450 --> 06:16.260
I failed to take care of you.

06:46.130 --> 06:48.530
Aman, let's go get more hot water.

07:06.890 --> 07:08.250
I'm fine.

07:15.660 --> 07:17.060
How is my father?

07:17.690 --> 07:19.330
We owe this to him.

07:20.980 --> 07:24.820
His Majesty will punish the Grand Princess.

07:31.100 --> 07:33.060
She that does evil shall find evil.

07:37.250 --> 07:38.650
Get well soon.

07:39.300 --> 07:41.020
Don't worry about other things.

07:41.540 --> 07:43.140
Speaking of other things,

07:44.420 --> 07:45.670
I need to go to Nanwu.

07:45.690 --> 07:46.860
You're too weak

07:46.860 --> 07:48.550
to travel.

07:48.570 --> 07:50.140
But I'm the Saintess.

07:50.810 --> 07:52.450
The war between Nanwu and Dazhou

07:52.450 --> 07:53.820
may break out anytime.

07:53.890 --> 07:54.910
I believe

07:54.930 --> 07:56.010
if I go back to Nanwu

07:56.010 --> 07:57.520
and persuade the Grand Elder

07:57.540 --> 07:58.660
to withdraw,

07:58.660 --> 08:00.300
the war between us

08:00.340 --> 08:02.450
can be avoided,

08:02.490 --> 08:03.370
and the people

08:03.370 --> 08:04.990
won't suffer calamity.

08:05.010 --> 08:06.500
I must

08:07.660 --> 08:09.060
take this trip.

08:09.220 --> 08:11.140
Only by fighting with our lives

08:11.490 --> 08:12.790
can we be together

08:12.810 --> 08:15.060
openly and honestly forever.

08:15.250 --> 08:16.370
If you go,

08:16.370 --> 08:18.650
we may never see each other again.

08:19.420 --> 08:20.780
But

08:20.940 --> 08:22.580
if I don't give it a try,

08:22.580 --> 08:23.940
I'll end up

08:24.460 --> 08:26.440
as a wandering ghost,

08:26.460 --> 08:29.650
drifting here and there as someone else

08:29.770 --> 08:31.960
and being separated

08:31.980 --> 08:34.140
from you and my family forever.

08:34.340 --> 08:35.810
I cannot

08:36.130 --> 08:38.260
live on like that.

08:38.290 --> 08:39.230
I'll go with you.

08:39.250 --> 08:40.510
You can't.

08:40.530 --> 08:42.110
If you went along,

08:42.130 --> 08:44.140
you'd be convicted of conspiracy.

08:44.290 --> 08:45.130
You have to go back.

08:45.130 --> 08:45.980
Only if you're back

08:45.980 --> 08:48.460
can you exonerate me
from escaping from prison.

08:53.530 --> 08:55.170
A brief parting

08:55.340 --> 08:56.700
is for

08:57.460 --> 08:59.860
an everlasting union.

09:07.460 --> 09:09.690
It's a maximum security prison.

09:09.740 --> 09:11.350
She got out right under your nose.

09:11.370 --> 09:13.460
Good-for-nothings!

09:15.530 --> 09:18.260
Issue an all-points bulletin

09:18.340 --> 09:19.930
nationwide.

09:20.250 --> 09:22.080
Princess Yan, Jiang Si,

09:22.100 --> 09:23.800
is Nanwu's Saintess.

09:23.820 --> 09:25.680
She deserves death.

09:25.700 --> 09:27.080
Whoever catches her,

09:27.100 --> 09:29.410
alive or dead, will be rewarded.

09:29.650 --> 09:31.010
Yes.

09:34.220 --> 09:35.270
Aman,

09:35.290 --> 09:36.350
Si wants to see you.

09:36.370 --> 09:37.350
Yes.

09:37.370 --> 09:39.320
How's Si, Yu?

09:39.340 --> 09:40.700
She's getting better.

09:43.220 --> 09:44.580
Miss,

09:45.620 --> 09:48.140
how are you? Do you feel better?

09:49.130 --> 09:50.620
Much better.

09:51.490 --> 09:53.050
It must've hurt badly.

09:56.410 --> 09:59.340
Aman, listen to me.

10:00.580 --> 10:04.040
I'm going to Nanwu tomorrow.

10:04.060 --> 10:05.200
Going to Nanwu?

10:05.220 --> 10:07.050
The jaws of death?

10:07.100 --> 10:08.390
She's made her decision.

10:08.410 --> 10:09.840
Would she listen to me?

10:10.340 --> 10:12.170
She can't go. I'll talk to her.

10:12.940 --> 10:14.330
Jiang Si knows how perilous it'll be

10:14.330 --> 10:15.230
better than we do.

10:15.250 --> 10:16.130
You know her well.

10:16.130 --> 10:17.690
You can't change her mind.

10:19.170 --> 10:22.720
The more people, the bigger the target.

10:22.740 --> 10:25.490
Promise me

10:25.490 --> 10:27.050
that you'll go back

10:27.740 --> 10:29.320
to look after my father

10:29.340 --> 10:31.050
and my family for me.

10:31.340 --> 10:32.630
But...

10:32.650 --> 10:33.980
I... I've never

10:33.980 --> 10:35.470
caused you any trouble.

10:35.490 --> 10:37.530
I only want to go with you.

10:38.500 --> 10:39.490
It's different this time.

10:39.490 --> 10:41.380
I need you to do as I say.

10:43.100 --> 10:45.770
I will, Miss. I promise you.

10:45.860 --> 10:47.860
I'll take care of everyone at home.

10:52.410 --> 10:53.920
I can't leave right now.

10:53.940 --> 10:55.800
Can any of you go with her?

10:55.820 --> 10:57.170
- I'll go.
- Me too.

10:57.170 --> 10:58.530
Count me in.

11:01.290 --> 11:03.410
This trip will be perilous.

11:03.460 --> 11:05.660
Qi, we have to take precautions.

11:11.720 --> 11:13.150
(Tiande Hall)

11:13.170 --> 11:16.110
"I'm indisposed and weak.

11:16.130 --> 11:19.110
For the sake of the state and the people,

11:19.130 --> 11:20.940
I appoint Grand Princess Rongyang

11:20.940 --> 11:22.390
regent.

11:22.410 --> 11:24.920
Officials shall fully assist her

11:24.940 --> 11:26.440
in achieving national prosperity.

11:26.460 --> 11:28.410
All shall obey her."

11:30.620 --> 11:31.520
A female regent?

11:31.530 --> 11:33.170
That's ridiculous!

11:33.170 --> 11:35.410
Indeed. It's illegal.

11:37.220 --> 11:39.750
Aunt, if Father fell sick,

11:39.770 --> 11:42.410
why didn't I hear anything about it?

11:42.700 --> 11:45.010
You should ask yourself.

11:45.290 --> 11:47.440
At a time like this, why did he

11:47.460 --> 11:50.530
seek help from me of all people?

11:55.890 --> 11:57.250
Your Highness,

11:57.410 --> 12:00.620
what has His Majesty come down with?

12:02.460 --> 12:05.010
Nanwu's troops at the border

12:06.340 --> 12:09.230
and the internal chaos
caused by their Saintess

12:09.250 --> 12:12.140
infuriated and concerned him,

12:13.010 --> 12:14.800
which took a toll on his health.

12:14.820 --> 12:18.320
May I take a look at the edict?

12:18.340 --> 12:19.200
How dare you

12:19.220 --> 12:20.600
doubt His Majesty!

12:20.620 --> 12:21.820
It was issued all of a sudden.

12:21.820 --> 12:23.860
I have to confirm if it was

12:23.860 --> 12:25.000
of His Majesty's free will

12:25.010 --> 12:26.650
before carrying it out.

12:26.890 --> 12:28.150
Iron Guards!

12:28.170 --> 12:32.510
I, Cao Yong, obey the edict.

12:32.530 --> 12:35.980
I'll do my utmost to assist Your Highness.

12:41.740 --> 12:44.470
A regent is of vital significance.

12:44.490 --> 12:45.840
His Majesty would appoint

12:45.860 --> 12:47.480
the one he trusted the most.

12:47.940 --> 12:51.260
The Grand Princess is most qualified.

12:54.460 --> 12:57.740
I'll obey the edict.

12:57.860 --> 12:59.220
Zhang!

13:00.060 --> 13:02.500
I'll obey the edict.

13:02.700 --> 13:04.750
I'll obey the edict.

13:04.770 --> 13:07.870
I'll obey the edict.

13:07.890 --> 13:10.290
I'll obey the edict.

13:11.170 --> 13:12.320
Your Majesty,

13:12.340 --> 13:14.010
is the Grand Princess

13:15.740 --> 13:17.980
going to usurp the throne?

13:18.170 --> 13:20.460
I don't think that's her intention.

13:21.250 --> 13:22.990
But Marquis Changxing

13:23.010 --> 13:24.510
is thirsty for power.

13:24.530 --> 13:27.410
The power struggle will intensify.

13:28.700 --> 13:30.840
If the Jade Seal remained in my hands,

13:30.860 --> 13:32.920
and they grabbed it from me,

13:32.940 --> 13:34.350
Dazhou would fall.

13:34.370 --> 13:35.800
Tell Cheng in secret

13:35.820 --> 13:37.470
to send the real Jade Seal

13:37.490 --> 13:38.890
to Zhen Heng.

13:39.370 --> 13:40.320
I'm sure

13:40.340 --> 13:42.690
Jin will soon receive it.

13:42.980 --> 13:44.290
You trust Prince Yan

13:44.290 --> 13:45.920
so much.

13:45.940 --> 13:47.300
I

13:47.770 --> 13:49.690
trust my judgment.

13:50.130 --> 13:51.200
Where's Prince Yan?

13:51.220 --> 13:52.510
Your Highness,

13:52.530 --> 13:55.380
he didn't come to the morning court.

13:55.620 --> 13:58.530
There's no sign of him anywhere.

13:59.460 --> 14:01.440
He must've fled Ling'an

14:01.460 --> 14:03.770
with Jiang Si.

14:04.410 --> 14:06.750
Marquis Changxing, Cao Yong.

14:06.770 --> 14:08.130
Your Highness.

14:08.700 --> 14:09.630
Prince Yan

14:09.650 --> 14:12.230
helped Nanwu's Saintess,
Jiang Si, escape from prison

14:12.250 --> 14:14.720
and fled with her. Bring him back.

14:14.740 --> 14:16.680
I'll interrogate him myself.

14:16.700 --> 14:18.060
Yes.

14:25.130 --> 14:26.490
Aunt,

14:27.890 --> 14:29.860
what am I guilty of?

14:32.860 --> 14:34.390
There you are.

14:34.410 --> 14:35.770
Where's Jiang Si?

14:36.100 --> 14:38.170
Isn't she in prison?

14:39.770 --> 14:42.470
Prince Yan, now that you're here,

14:42.490 --> 14:44.080
I don't need to bring you over.

14:44.100 --> 14:45.740
Guards, seize Prince Yan!

14:45.740 --> 14:47.100
I dare you!

14:49.620 --> 14:50.600
Aunt,

14:50.620 --> 14:52.580
he's overreaching himself

14:52.650 --> 14:54.100
right in your face.

14:54.530 --> 14:55.890
Shut up!

14:59.410 --> 15:00.770
Oh, I see.

15:01.650 --> 15:03.110
You're acting as regent,

15:03.130 --> 15:04.390
but Cao Yong

15:04.410 --> 15:05.890
means to kill

15:05.890 --> 15:06.800
your nephew.

15:06.820 --> 15:08.580
I wouldn't dare!

15:17.650 --> 15:19.220
I'm here.

15:19.410 --> 15:21.170
No one would dare harm you.

15:21.740 --> 15:24.620
If you don't side with Nanwu's Saintess,

15:25.010 --> 15:26.740
from now on,

15:27.130 --> 15:28.980
no one will give you a hard time.

15:31.820 --> 15:34.580
Your wish is my command, Aunt.

15:39.280 --> 15:42.800
(Taiji Hall, Tiande Hall)

16:07.770 --> 16:09.150
Mr. Zhen, is it you?

16:09.170 --> 16:11.100
Yes, Your Highness.

16:11.220 --> 16:13.290
Mr. Zhen, my aunt...

16:14.370 --> 16:16.050
She staged a revolt.

16:16.100 --> 16:17.460
A revolt?

16:18.100 --> 16:19.470
How is His Majesty doing?

16:19.490 --> 16:20.850
I'm not sure.

16:20.980 --> 16:23.150
Speed Guards have
surrounded Father's chamber.

16:23.170 --> 16:25.050
Soldiers are all over the harem.

16:26.370 --> 16:28.270
Imperial Insignia Guards were always here.

16:28.290 --> 16:29.740
Why are the Speed Guards on duty?

16:29.760 --> 16:31.350
(Funing Palace)
Your Highness,

16:31.370 --> 16:32.800
it's His Majesty's decision.

16:32.820 --> 16:34.150
We're following his order.

16:34.170 --> 16:36.010
His Majesty's decision?

16:39.860 --> 16:41.620
Your Highness! Your Highness!

16:41.620 --> 16:42.980
Your Highness,

16:45.580 --> 16:47.110
His Majesty said

16:47.130 --> 16:49.510
he wouldn't see anyone today.

16:49.530 --> 16:50.770
If he simply fell ill,

16:50.770 --> 16:51.960
why wouldn't he see others?

16:51.980 --> 16:53.710
Even if he refused to see officials,

16:53.730 --> 16:54.620
would he also not

16:54.620 --> 16:55.980
let his own sons in?

16:56.210 --> 16:58.970
Father, Yu Lang came to see you!

16:59.370 --> 17:02.020
Yu Zhang wants to see you, too!

17:03.690 --> 17:05.050
Your Highness!

17:08.890 --> 17:10.730
What's all the fuss about?

17:10.820 --> 17:12.450
Do I hear

17:12.730 --> 17:14.860
Lang's and Zhang's voices?

17:15.450 --> 17:17.340
Please don't make it hard for me.

17:26.020 --> 17:28.390
Looks like His Majesty is indeed sick.

17:28.410 --> 17:29.910
Mr. Han, please

17:29.930 --> 17:31.110
keep guarding the gate.

17:31.130 --> 17:32.020
Don't let anyone in

17:32.020 --> 17:33.820
to disturb His Majesty.

17:34.840 --> 17:37.080
(Funing Palace)

17:37.100 --> 17:38.390
Your Majesty,

17:38.410 --> 17:40.080
they asked to see you

17:40.100 --> 17:41.760
but then became quiet.

17:41.780 --> 17:43.890
Were they stopped by those guards?

17:47.730 --> 17:49.090
Your Majesty,

17:50.300 --> 17:51.780
shall I send

17:52.450 --> 17:54.560
a secret message to the princes?

17:54.580 --> 17:55.500
Do you think

17:55.500 --> 17:57.170
Rongyang's soft?

17:58.020 --> 18:00.690
The messenger would've been killed

18:00.730 --> 18:02.860
before your message was sent out.

18:03.780 --> 18:04.820
Zhang, when did you

18:04.820 --> 18:06.430
ally yourself with the Grand Princess?

18:06.450 --> 18:07.860
You'd rather disregard

18:07.860 --> 18:09.000
Father's safety.

18:09.020 --> 18:11.890
Aunt must've promised you
tremendous benefits

18:12.450 --> 18:15.490
such as the throne.

18:17.500 --> 18:19.650
What rebellious remarks.

18:19.930 --> 18:22.380
Don't say such things again, Crown Prince.

18:23.020 --> 18:24.380
Zhang,

18:25.860 --> 18:27.620
if Father's in danger,

18:27.860 --> 18:29.890
we'll end up in a lose-lose situation.

18:30.020 --> 18:31.840
Only if we join hands

18:31.860 --> 18:33.190
to get Father out

18:33.210 --> 18:34.860
can everyone win.

18:39.580 --> 18:41.000
When Father's unwell,

18:41.020 --> 18:42.910
Aunt is giving it her all to serve the state.

18:42.930 --> 18:43.820
We're Father's sons,

18:43.820 --> 18:45.250
but she's more devoted.

18:45.570 --> 18:46.410
Yet here you're

18:46.410 --> 18:48.450
questioning her loyalty.

18:48.500 --> 18:51.780
With all due respect, that's improper.

18:56.580 --> 18:59.130
(He must've paid allegiance)

18:59.130 --> 19:00.690
(to Aunt a long time ago.)

19:01.060 --> 19:02.390
(If so, )

19:02.410 --> 19:04.690
(I'll show no mercy to him.)

19:05.890 --> 19:07.210
The Crown Prince tried to persuade

19:07.210 --> 19:08.820
Prince Qi to bring you down,

19:08.890 --> 19:10.520
but Prince Qi said no

19:10.540 --> 19:12.420
and that he'd support your regency.

19:12.780 --> 19:15.340
He can always size up the situation.

19:15.860 --> 19:17.080
He and His Majesty

19:17.100 --> 19:19.060
weren't truly close.

19:19.410 --> 19:21.340
He wouldn't risk himself

19:21.450 --> 19:24.250
for anyone including his father.

19:24.780 --> 19:28.060
But the Crown Prince isn't him.

19:29.970 --> 19:33.340
Guess what he'll do.

19:35.620 --> 19:37.190
Invite him to the Palace

19:37.210 --> 19:39.410
to dine with me tomorrow.

19:41.370 --> 19:43.140
I'd like to see

19:43.730 --> 19:45.970
how far he can go.

19:54.130 --> 19:56.190
Chuchu, leave with Si.

19:56.210 --> 19:57.600
Du'er and I will cover for you.

19:57.620 --> 19:59.710
Split up and meet us in the South.

19:59.730 --> 20:01.090
Don't worry.

20:01.340 --> 20:02.480
See you there.

20:02.500 --> 20:03.860
Let's go.

20:11.020 --> 20:12.380
Zhan,

20:13.890 --> 20:15.250
take care.

20:32.970 --> 20:34.400
Let's go the other way.

20:36.410 --> 20:38.480
How exactly is my father?

20:38.650 --> 20:40.180
Princess Fuqing said

20:40.370 --> 20:41.870
he was confined to his chamber.

20:41.890 --> 20:43.100
The top priority is

20:43.100 --> 20:45.560
to figure out a way to rescue him.

20:45.580 --> 20:46.540
Imperial Insignia Guards

20:46.540 --> 20:47.910
in the Palace have been replaced

20:47.930 --> 20:49.650
by Iron Guards, Speed Guards,

20:49.650 --> 20:51.110
and Marquis Changxing's guards.

20:51.130 --> 20:53.100
We're way outnumbered.

20:53.730 --> 20:55.620
If we broke in unprepared,

20:56.500 --> 20:58.240
we won't be able to rescue His Majesty,

20:58.260 --> 20:59.910
only to make things even worse.

20:59.930 --> 21:01.290
You have a point.

21:02.020 --> 21:03.730
No one in Ling'an is

21:03.730 --> 21:05.450
the Grand Princess's match.

21:05.820 --> 21:07.410
Urgent news from the front.

21:08.060 --> 21:10.490
Nanwu's troops have invaded

21:12.060 --> 21:13.390
several of our towns

21:13.410 --> 21:15.710
and firebombed them.

21:15.730 --> 21:17.520
This is my first time as regent.

21:17.540 --> 21:20.210
At this moment of life or death,

21:22.890 --> 21:26.110
maybe I should take this chance

21:26.130 --> 21:28.060
to establish my authority.

21:28.210 --> 21:30.970
What's your advice, Marquis?

21:33.820 --> 21:35.180
Your Highness,

21:35.650 --> 21:37.110
as far as I know,

21:37.130 --> 21:38.800
Nanwu launched attacks

21:38.820 --> 21:40.820
because of their Saintess.

21:41.100 --> 21:44.210
If she falls into our hands,

21:44.260 --> 21:45.100
we can use her

21:45.100 --> 21:47.890
to make their troops withdraw.

21:48.210 --> 21:50.100
Order all the exits

21:50.130 --> 21:53.540
and gates to search everyone carefully.

21:54.100 --> 21:56.350
We must find her as soon as possible.

21:56.370 --> 21:58.690
To deal with Marquis Changxing

21:59.100 --> 22:00.930
and turn things around,

22:01.890 --> 22:03.300
he's our only hope.

22:03.690 --> 22:05.090
- Cui Xu.
- Correct.

22:05.100 --> 22:06.020
But General Cui is

22:06.020 --> 22:07.560
the Grand Princess's husband.

22:07.580 --> 22:09.000
Will he help us?

22:09.020 --> 22:11.620
He's faithful to the state and the people.

22:11.890 --> 22:13.320
He'd never go along with her

22:13.340 --> 22:14.700
in her evil deeds.

22:14.730 --> 22:15.930
Where are his troops stationed?

22:15.930 --> 22:17.000
The Yanxi Camp.

22:17.020 --> 22:18.430
Send a message to the Chiyu Cavalry.

22:18.430 --> 22:19.350
Have them escort us

22:19.370 --> 22:20.950
to General Cui's camp.

22:20.970 --> 22:22.330
Yes.

22:24.650 --> 22:26.300
You should be careful, too.

22:26.410 --> 22:28.240
Whatever we can think of,

22:28.260 --> 22:29.390
so can Marquis Changxing

22:29.410 --> 22:30.600
and the Grand Princess.

22:30.620 --> 22:32.270
Once they spot any sign of you,

22:32.290 --> 22:33.630
you'll be hunted.

22:33.650 --> 22:35.680
She's eager to establish her authority,

22:35.780 --> 22:37.320
so she'll make an example of officials.

22:37.320 --> 22:38.410
You're in greater danger.

22:38.410 --> 22:40.100
Why not go with me?

22:40.970 --> 22:43.020
Soldiers are all over the harem.

22:43.540 --> 22:44.520
I'm scared!

22:44.540 --> 22:47.100
Everything will be fine, Your Highness.

22:47.170 --> 22:48.280
I'll figure out a plan.

22:48.300 --> 22:50.140
If anything happens in the Palace,

22:50.300 --> 22:51.390
fly the kite.

22:51.410 --> 22:52.480
When I see it,

22:52.500 --> 22:53.710
I'll come to you.

22:53.730 --> 22:56.780
Be very careful, Your Highness.

23:04.130 --> 23:05.490
Your Highness,

23:05.730 --> 23:07.090
I'll stay in Ling'an.

23:07.300 --> 23:08.510
The Empress and Princess Fuqing

23:08.510 --> 23:09.710
remain in the Palace.

23:09.730 --> 23:11.910
Someone has to hold the Grand Princess back.

23:11.930 --> 23:14.450
Once you return, I can

23:14.470 --> 23:15.980
help you from the inside.

23:17.020 --> 23:18.350
Alright.

23:18.370 --> 23:19.770
Take care of yourself.

23:19.930 --> 23:20.910
If possible,

23:20.930 --> 23:23.400
sound Prince Qi and the Crown Prince out.

23:23.540 --> 23:24.630
The enemy is formidable.

23:24.650 --> 23:26.640
We could use more allies.

23:31.320 --> 23:35.160
(Princess Yan, Jiang Si,
is Nanwu's Saintess.)

23:36.730 --> 23:38.090
Go.

23:44.170 --> 23:45.860
What to do, Young Master Zhan?

23:48.370 --> 23:49.730
Keep up.

23:50.970 --> 23:52.080
That woman looks suspicious.

23:52.100 --> 23:53.460
Stop her!

23:54.890 --> 23:56.240
She's Nanwu's Saintess!

23:56.260 --> 23:57.670
Go! Seize her!

23:57.690 --> 23:58.800
- Hurry!
- Go!

23:58.820 --> 24:00.180
Go! Stop!

24:11.930 --> 24:13.080
Jiang Si,

24:13.100 --> 24:14.350
how are you holding up?

24:14.370 --> 24:15.560
I'm fine.

24:15.580 --> 24:17.210
Go as fast as you can.

24:25.580 --> 24:26.970
I'll fetch some water.

24:40.410 --> 24:41.520
Not her.

24:41.540 --> 24:42.760
Come on. Let's go.

24:42.780 --> 24:43.760
Your Highness,

24:43.780 --> 24:45.280
some civilians said

24:45.300 --> 24:47.350
they saw someone looking like the Saintess

24:47.370 --> 24:48.730
going southward.

24:49.300 --> 24:50.660
The South.

24:51.260 --> 24:53.540
They must've gone to the South.

24:54.860 --> 24:57.250
Prince Yan can mobilize the Chiyu Cavalry.

24:57.340 --> 24:59.350
Cui Xu's troops are also there.

24:59.370 --> 25:01.060
Jiang Si

25:01.130 --> 25:03.340
can call on those of Nanwu to help her.

25:05.860 --> 25:07.380
Do they think

25:07.540 --> 25:09.490
they can defeat me with their help?

25:10.060 --> 25:12.780
Shijiu, issue an edict.

25:12.820 --> 25:15.480
Order the Chiyu Cavalry and Cui Xu's troops

25:15.500 --> 25:18.340
to invade Nanwu and fight to the end.

25:19.020 --> 25:20.860
They cannot return

25:21.780 --> 25:24.620
until Nanwu's seized.

25:35.210 --> 25:37.550
An all-points bulletin for me
has been issued.

25:38.260 --> 25:39.300
I wonder if everything

25:39.300 --> 25:40.660
is fine at home

25:41.020 --> 25:42.800
and if my family will be implicated.

25:42.820 --> 25:45.170
And how are things at Zhan's end?

25:45.820 --> 25:47.390
Are they hunted?

25:47.410 --> 25:49.320
No one has gone after us along the way,

25:49.340 --> 25:50.820
let alone them.

25:51.410 --> 25:52.930
I hope so.

25:53.450 --> 25:55.410
I hope all goes well.

25:55.650 --> 25:57.010
It will.

25:58.100 --> 26:01.140
(Yu Qi, are you alright?)

26:10.480 --> 26:16.120
♪ To write to you, a few words make a book ♪

26:17.380 --> 26:23.140
♪ Mottled fate reaches the end ♪

26:23.810 --> 26:30.190
♪ Hope to embrace eternity with you ♪

26:30.210 --> 26:36.820
♪ As if in a dream, petals fall on the paper ♪

26:37.010 --> 26:40.430
♪ Looking back, everything is ♪

26:40.440 --> 26:43.840
♪ Difficult to untangle ♪

26:43.900 --> 26:49.550
♪ All is to guard my love for you ♪

26:50.780 --> 26:54.270
♪ Morning mist's reduced to dew ♪

26:54.270 --> 26:57.620
♪ The sun rises as usual ♪

26:57.640 --> 27:03.720
♪ In this lifetime,
I only want to be with you ♪

27:12.130 --> 27:12.970
Chief,

27:12.970 --> 27:13.820
go over this mountain

27:13.820 --> 27:15.240
and we'll be in Yangui.

27:15.860 --> 27:17.190
- Can you hold on?
- I'm fine.

27:17.210 --> 27:18.780
Time is pressing. Let's go.

27:29.000 --> 27:32.520
(Crown Prince's Mansion)

27:33.300 --> 27:34.200
Your Highness,

27:34.210 --> 27:35.340
your wife and child have been

27:35.340 --> 27:36.970
sent to her family.

27:47.060 --> 27:50.170
I handpicked you to fight to the death.

27:50.340 --> 27:51.520
Tomorrow is our only chance

27:51.540 --> 27:53.060
and last chance to act.

27:53.100 --> 27:54.130
You'll go to the Palace

27:54.130 --> 27:56.600
with me as musicians.

27:56.620 --> 27:57.980
- Yes.
- Yes.

27:59.300 --> 28:00.220
Your Highness,

28:00.240 --> 28:01.410
we still haven't found Yu Jin.

28:01.410 --> 28:02.520
Still not?

28:02.540 --> 28:04.520
Send more people to look for him.

28:04.540 --> 28:06.450
Whatever it takes,

28:06.730 --> 28:08.150
you must find him.

28:08.170 --> 28:09.530
Yes.

28:12.620 --> 28:13.760
Your Highness,

28:13.780 --> 28:15.730
the Crown Prince came to see you.

28:16.300 --> 28:17.660
Send him in.

28:18.500 --> 28:21.060
Greetings, Aunt.

28:21.300 --> 28:22.930
Crown Prince,

28:23.130 --> 28:24.970
who are they...?

28:25.730 --> 28:26.800
Aunt,

28:26.820 --> 28:27.820
I selected a group

28:27.820 --> 28:28.870
of musicians for you.

28:28.890 --> 28:30.620
All of them are highly skilled.

28:31.340 --> 28:32.280
Two days ago,

28:32.300 --> 28:34.150
I was so worried about Father's illness

28:34.170 --> 28:35.190
that I said things

28:35.210 --> 28:36.870
I shouldn't have at the morning court

28:36.890 --> 28:38.000
and offended you.

28:38.020 --> 28:40.390
Here I am to apologize.

28:40.410 --> 28:42.000
With you safeguarding Dazhou,

28:42.020 --> 28:44.000
the state will thrive

28:44.020 --> 28:46.320
in peace and harmony.

28:46.340 --> 28:48.450
I'm glad you've come around.

28:48.540 --> 28:49.900
Be seated.

29:01.620 --> 29:02.980
Lang,

29:03.730 --> 29:06.320
how do you feel about me

29:06.340 --> 29:07.780
acting as regent?

29:07.890 --> 29:09.130
I want to hear

29:09.130 --> 29:10.840
your heartfelt words.

29:10.860 --> 29:12.670
At first, I disapproved

29:12.690 --> 29:14.300
of your action.

29:14.890 --> 29:16.580
By rights,

29:16.620 --> 29:19.300
I should act as regent.

29:19.340 --> 29:21.780
Are those your heartfelt words?

29:23.650 --> 29:25.300
Don't get me wrong, Aunt.

29:25.410 --> 29:26.540
I soon realized

29:26.540 --> 29:28.340
you did so for my sake.

29:28.690 --> 29:30.780
That's why I came to apologize.

29:31.260 --> 29:33.150
I know I'm incapable.

29:33.170 --> 29:34.560
If anything bad happened,

29:34.580 --> 29:37.140
Father would blame me.

29:37.450 --> 29:38.820
More importantly,

29:38.890 --> 29:40.150
you tried to

29:40.170 --> 29:41.890
look out for me.

29:42.170 --> 29:44.190
I still have a lot to learn.

29:44.210 --> 29:46.250
I'm glad you know.

29:46.930 --> 29:49.670
Thank you for your service.

29:49.690 --> 29:51.650
I toast you, Aunt.

30:06.130 --> 30:07.490
Your Majesty.

30:08.340 --> 30:09.700
What?

30:24.020 --> 30:25.380
What's up?

30:25.620 --> 30:28.170
Father is in grave danger.

30:28.580 --> 30:30.690
You stole the throne from me

30:31.540 --> 30:33.410
and killed my mother.

30:33.580 --> 30:35.820
I'll avenge her murder on you!

30:42.370 --> 30:43.780
The Grand Princess

30:44.730 --> 30:47.450
killed... killed the Crown Prince!

31:22.280 --> 31:26.280
(Taiji Hall, Tiande Hall)

31:35.860 --> 31:39.170
Greetings, Your Highness.

31:39.540 --> 31:42.600
I canceled this morning's court

31:42.620 --> 31:43.580
because I heard

31:43.580 --> 31:45.870
someone colluded with other officials

31:45.890 --> 31:47.710
to impeach me.

31:47.730 --> 31:49.730
You've devoted yourself to Dazhou.

31:50.100 --> 31:51.170
Those fools shouldn't have

31:51.170 --> 31:52.350
ganged up on you.

31:52.370 --> 31:53.950
Ideally,

31:53.970 --> 31:54.930
you couldn't wait

31:54.930 --> 31:56.150
for me to be in power

31:56.170 --> 31:58.170
to make you the Emperor.

31:58.340 --> 31:59.350
But now,

31:59.370 --> 32:01.760
those senior officials

32:01.780 --> 32:03.890
are giving me a headache.

32:06.540 --> 32:07.930
I need

32:07.930 --> 32:09.280
someone capable

32:09.300 --> 32:11.190
of pacifying them.

32:11.210 --> 32:13.930
You're a prince.

32:14.480 --> 32:16.650
Whether you'll help me or not

32:16.670 --> 32:18.780
is up to you.

32:20.450 --> 32:22.040
Your regency is perfectly justified.

32:22.060 --> 32:23.600
I ought to assist you.

32:23.620 --> 32:24.980
Very well.

32:25.650 --> 32:27.250
Relay my message.

32:27.410 --> 32:32.280
The Crown Prince staged a revolt last night.

32:32.300 --> 32:36.380
I've had him executed.

32:41.860 --> 32:43.320
I'll learn from his crime.

32:43.340 --> 32:46.340
I, Yu Zhang, will forever be loyal to you.

32:49.930 --> 32:53.540
(Zhang, you're smart enough)

32:53.890 --> 32:56.060
(to know what to do.)

32:56.620 --> 32:57.980
(I understand.)

33:10.540 --> 33:11.800
Prince Qi

33:11.820 --> 33:14.140
seems to have yielded to the Grand Princess.

33:14.580 --> 33:15.840
What about Jin?

33:15.860 --> 33:17.380
Prince Yan

33:17.500 --> 33:19.580
has left Ling'an overnight.

33:20.020 --> 33:21.350
Right now,

33:21.370 --> 33:23.580
in all of Dazhou, only one person

33:24.340 --> 33:26.730
can deal with Rongyang.

33:28.130 --> 33:29.490
Do you mean...

33:30.340 --> 33:31.700
General Cui?

33:34.540 --> 33:36.210
He and Prince Yan

33:36.580 --> 33:38.540
will join forces to rescue you.

33:48.320 --> 33:49.840
(Yangui)

33:49.840 --> 33:52.360
(Zhou)

33:56.160 --> 34:02.190
(Yangui)

34:02.210 --> 34:03.850
Welcome back, General Yu.

34:05.810 --> 34:07.000
All rise.

34:07.020 --> 34:08.670
Chief, what took you so long?

34:08.690 --> 34:10.040
Have all of you been well?

34:10.060 --> 34:11.630
As soon as I received your message,

34:11.650 --> 34:13.040
I gathered all our men

34:13.060 --> 34:14.100
and started training them.

34:14.100 --> 34:15.330
(Leng Ying)
They're in their best shape

34:15.331 --> 34:16.670
(Chiyu Cavalryman)
waiting for your return.

34:16.690 --> 34:18.050
What about Nanwu?

34:18.130 --> 34:20.330
They're ready to act. I'm afraid...

34:33.770 --> 34:35.120
Darling!

34:35.140 --> 34:36.940
Something happened in the Palace.

34:44.460 --> 34:45.400
Prince Qi,

34:45.420 --> 34:47.170
Mr. Zhen, Zhen Heng, is here.

35:02.210 --> 35:04.250
What brings you to my place

35:04.620 --> 35:06.140
this late, Mr. Zhen?

35:06.770 --> 35:08.080
Prince Qi,

35:08.100 --> 35:09.460
the Crown Prince

35:09.620 --> 35:11.500
was killed by the Grand Princess.

35:11.810 --> 35:14.310
I was one step too late.

35:14.330 --> 35:15.670
That's why

35:15.690 --> 35:17.760
I implore you to save His Majesty

35:17.980 --> 35:19.080
with me.

35:19.100 --> 35:20.730
His Majesty is only sick.

35:21.100 --> 35:22.750
What do you mean by save him?

35:22.900 --> 35:24.810
Or has his condition worsened?

35:25.330 --> 35:26.620
Stop pretending, Prince Qi.

35:26.620 --> 35:28.150
You know what happened.

35:28.170 --> 35:31.400
But I believe you didn't choose to

35:31.420 --> 35:34.040
collude with the Grand Princess

35:34.060 --> 35:35.580
or mean to

35:36.770 --> 35:38.690
seize the throne.

35:39.020 --> 35:40.440
How dare you try to read my mind!

35:40.460 --> 35:43.310
Your Highness, a state can't be leaderless!

35:43.330 --> 35:44.630
The Crown Prince is dead.

35:44.650 --> 35:46.020
Prince Qi

35:46.250 --> 35:48.670
isn't loyal to you wholeheartedly.

35:48.690 --> 35:50.480
Although he's paid allegiance to you,

35:50.500 --> 35:51.960
his mother is still alive.

35:51.980 --> 35:54.080
If you make him the new Emperor,

35:54.100 --> 35:55.060
you're unlikely

35:55.060 --> 35:57.080
to hold court from behind a screen

35:57.100 --> 35:58.150
or be in power.

35:58.170 --> 35:59.940
Your Highness,

36:00.170 --> 36:01.790
are you satisfied

36:01.810 --> 36:03.580
with being a mere regent?

36:06.770 --> 36:09.060
Forgive me if I cross the line,

36:09.210 --> 36:12.170
but why not proclaim yourself queen?

36:12.290 --> 36:15.270
If things drag on

36:15.290 --> 36:17.400
until those officials gang up on you,

36:17.420 --> 36:20.000
forcing you to step down,

36:20.020 --> 36:22.650
you'll have no way out.

36:23.810 --> 36:25.250
You're right.

36:26.460 --> 36:28.900
I've lost everything.

36:29.460 --> 36:31.640
Instead of sitting still waiting for death,

36:32.330 --> 36:35.250
I'd rather sit on that throne

36:35.810 --> 36:37.540
to gain all.

37:10.440 --> 37:13.360
(I've decided to hand over the throne
to Grand Princess Rongyang.)

37:13.380 --> 37:14.740
Rongyang,

37:16.210 --> 37:17.500
you claimed to take revenge

37:17.500 --> 37:19.150
for Mingyue.

37:19.170 --> 37:21.780
Turns out, all that you've done

37:21.780 --> 37:24.330
is to usurp my throne.

37:30.250 --> 37:31.810
Whatever.

37:32.130 --> 37:33.520
At this stage,

37:33.540 --> 37:35.630
you'd better sign the edict

37:35.650 --> 37:37.250
and hand over the Jade Seal.

37:37.580 --> 37:38.630
As you know,

37:38.650 --> 37:40.690
I'm not the patient type.

37:55.100 --> 37:56.580
I'll talk to General Cui

37:56.580 --> 37:58.440
about how we can rescue His Majesty.

37:58.460 --> 37:59.790
You stay here and rest.

37:59.810 --> 38:01.230
When entering the gate,

38:01.250 --> 38:02.960
I saw the Chiyu Cavalrymen

38:02.980 --> 38:04.360
on high alert.

38:04.380 --> 38:05.310
And there were signs

38:05.320 --> 38:07.500
of a firebomb attack in town.

38:07.730 --> 38:09.690
Clearly, Nanwu is

38:09.690 --> 38:11.600
ready to launch attacks.

38:11.620 --> 38:12.710
In this case,

38:12.730 --> 38:14.480
General Cui won't leave the border

38:14.500 --> 38:16.080
to rescue His Majesty with you.

38:16.100 --> 38:17.800
Only if Nanwu's troops retreat

38:18.580 --> 38:20.150
will there be a slim chance of survival.

38:20.170 --> 38:21.620
However hard it is,

38:22.100 --> 38:23.540
I must have a try.

38:29.900 --> 38:31.260
Jiang!

38:34.100 --> 38:34.940
Jiang!

38:34.940 --> 38:35.880
Chuchu!

38:35.900 --> 38:37.260
Zhan!

38:37.940 --> 38:39.400
- Chuchu!
- Jiang Zhan!

38:41.020 --> 38:42.380
Jiang Zhan!

38:44.170 --> 38:45.530
Zhan, drink.

38:46.330 --> 38:47.690
Have some water.

38:50.980 --> 38:52.370
What happened?

38:53.100 --> 38:54.460
Si,

38:56.540 --> 38:57.980
it was all my fault.

38:59.100 --> 39:01.020
I wasn't able to save them.

39:01.650 --> 39:02.830
What are you talking about?

39:02.850 --> 39:04.210
Who do you mean?

39:05.900 --> 39:07.810
Aman and Du'er...

39:10.690 --> 39:12.330
died.

39:14.500 --> 39:15.860
Aman?

39:16.250 --> 39:17.150
How come?

39:17.170 --> 39:19.150
Why was she with you?

39:19.170 --> 39:21.210
I had told her to leave.

39:24.460 --> 39:26.210
She lied to you.

39:26.580 --> 39:28.000
We'll stick to the plan.

39:28.020 --> 39:30.170
Split up and meet in the South.

39:30.770 --> 39:32.130
Young Master Zhan!

39:33.460 --> 39:34.820
Aman?

39:35.540 --> 39:37.230
Didn't Si tell you to leave?

39:37.250 --> 39:38.880
I'll go with you.

39:38.900 --> 39:40.670
Why are you in Si's dress?

39:40.690 --> 39:42.370
This is my idea.

39:42.460 --> 39:44.580
She and the others will be safer.

39:44.980 --> 39:46.630
- Aman...
- Young Master Zhan,

39:46.650 --> 39:48.200
I've made up my mind.

39:48.220 --> 39:49.630
(...Jiang Si is Nanwu's Saintess.)

39:49.630 --> 39:51.330
What to do, Young Master Zhan?

39:53.420 --> 39:55.770
Keep up, Aman.

40:10.130 --> 40:12.090
- Shoot!
- Watch out!

40:17.850 --> 40:19.530
- Come on!
- Hold him!

40:51.770 --> 40:53.650
Surrender now!

41:00.940 --> 41:02.300
Shoot!

41:03.650 --> 41:06.060
No, stop!

41:07.770 --> 41:09.540
Du'er, Du'er!

41:10.020 --> 41:11.630
The Grand Princess ordered us

41:11.650 --> 41:13.420
to seize the Saintess alive!

41:21.100 --> 41:22.650
Without Miss Si,

41:23.460 --> 41:25.940
I would starved to death on the streets.

41:27.580 --> 41:28.940
Finally,

41:29.730 --> 41:32.250
I can repay her for saving my life.

41:34.940 --> 41:36.770
You won't be able to seize me!

42:25.020 --> 42:27.580
Pull yourself together, Jiang Si.

42:28.060 --> 42:29.400
Don't forget

42:29.420 --> 42:31.310
you're Nanwu's Saintess.

42:31.330 --> 42:32.580
They risked their lives

42:32.580 --> 42:33.790
so that you could come here.

42:33.810 --> 42:35.620
Nanwu is so close.

42:36.170 --> 42:38.060
Are you going to give up?

42:49.440 --> 42:53.840
(The End of Episode 38)

42:54.251 --> 42:55.981
♪ From place to place ♪

42:55.981 --> 43:00.921
♪ I drift in the world alone ♪

43:01.291 --> 43:03.671
♪ The cool breeze comes and goes ♪

43:03.671 --> 43:07.901
♪ I dare to love and hate ♪

43:08.611 --> 43:11.011
♪ Ask the day and the night ♪

43:11.031 --> 43:14.691
♪ If they saw a glimmer fall and take root ♪

43:14.711 --> 43:18.131
♪ Growing between us ♪

43:18.281 --> 43:23.801
♪ And breeding love ♪

43:24.621 --> 43:28.301
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

43:28.301 --> 43:32.381
♪ In the end, we're still together ♪

43:32.621 --> 43:34.361
♪ Like shadows ♪

43:34.381 --> 43:39.081
♪ We're brave enough to advance together ♪

43:39.081 --> 43:42.651
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

43:42.671 --> 43:46.901
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

43:46.921 --> 43:48.701
♪ Time glows ♪

43:48.701 --> 43:53.241
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

43:53.261 --> 43:58.061
♪ And stars ♪

44:02.291 --> 44:04.821
♪ Don't ask what our fate is ♪

44:04.841 --> 44:08.461
♪ Let life carve the growth rings ♪

44:08.481 --> 44:11.911
♪ We'll reach the end eventually ♪

44:11.931 --> 44:16.551
♪ All will bloom in spring ♪

44:16.551 --> 44:20.241
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

44:20.261 --> 44:24.351
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

44:24.461 --> 44:26.281
♪ Time glows ♪

44:26.281 --> 44:30.831
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

44:30.851 --> 44:34.551
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

44:34.571 --> 44:38.731
♪ We travel at night in the cold ♪

44:38.911 --> 44:40.671
♪ The moonlight shines like water ♪

44:40.671 --> 44:45.191
♪ Those in love will have sweet dreams ♪

44:45.191 --> 44:48.831
♪ Cherish each other in the future ♪

44:48.851 --> 44:54.521
♪ Time goes by, but memories remain ♪

44:56.211 --> 44:58.141
♪ Take a look to remember everything ♪

44:58.141 --> 45:05.641
♪ We will see flowers fill the city again ♪
